# Skills under .claude/skills/ come from two sources:
#   • `npx skills add`  — tracked in skills-lock.json, restored by the CLI → NOT committed
#   • OpenSpec (`openspec init/update`) — no lockfile → committed, like .claude/commands/opsx
# So: ignore all skills, then re-include the OpenSpec-generated ones (openspec-* prefix).
/skills/*
!/skills/openspec-*/

# Local-only Claude Code settings (per-machine permissions, etc.) — never share.
/settings.local.json

# Runtime state written by the harness (scheduled tasks, etc.) — never commit.
/*.lock
